cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is an AI-produced research artifact that has not been reviewed
  by a human domain expert and makes no priority claim. If you refer to it, please
  cite it as a software/preprint artifact and read docs/PRIOR_ART.md and
  docs/VERIFICATION.md for scope and status.
title: "Coherent Subsystem Recovery: exact sharp recovery bounds from a three-branch coherent test"
abstract: >-
  Exact certificates and matching constructions for a sharp, dimension-independent
  qubit-recovery bound R >= (3f-1)/2 (completed to R_min(f) = max{1/4, 3f/4, (3f-1)/2})
  from a three-branch coherent test of an addressed subsystem, where a later decoder may
  use an arbitrary finite-dimensional quantum bypass. Verified in exact arithmetic; not
  human-reviewed; no historical priority asserted.
type: software
authors:
